        <title type="html"><![CDATA[From Shadow AI to Detection and Response: Closing the Visibility Gap at Machine Speed]]></title>
        <id>https://www.stream.security/post/from-shadow-ai-to-complete-visibility-detection-and-response</id>
        <link href="https://www.stream.security/post/from-shadow-ai-to-complete-visibility-detection-and-response"/>
        <updated>2026-04-27T00:00:00.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img alt="" loading="lazy" id="w-node-_2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63771-83c22e73" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/69edccb56ebbf31d235b783e_ai%20workload%20cover.png" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/69edccb56ebbf31d235b783e_ai%20workload%20cover-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/69edccb56ebbf31d235b783e_ai%20workload%20cover-p-800.png 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/69edccb56ebbf31d235b783e_ai%20workload%20cover-p-1080.png 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/69edccb56ebbf31d235b783e_ai%20workload%20cover.png 1200w" class="post-image"><div class="post-content-div"><div class="div-block-992"><div class="div-block-1010"><div fs-list-field="category" class="blog-category">AI Detection &amp; Response</div><div class="highlight-tag pop w-condition-invisible">Popular</div><div class="highlight-tag w-condition-invisible">Highlights</div><div class="hide w-dyn-list"><div class="w-dyn-empty"><div>No items found.</div></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775_instance-5" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%2269eb4fe28f9a9c217b76ac0d%22%7D%5D" href="/post/from-shadow-ai-to-complete-visibility-detection-and-response" class="b-title w-inline-block"><h2 fs-list-field="title" class="heading-29 blog">From Shadow AI to Detection and Response: Closing the Visibility Gap at Machine Speed</h2><div class="blog-par limit-char">AI workloads are dynamic, abstracted, and deeply embedded into modern applications, making them hard to track with traditional security tools. This creates a growing “shadow AI” problem where models, agents, and tools operate without oversight. Our AI workload discovery solves this by continuously analyzing cloud-native logs and runtime signals to identify all AI components in your environment—including hosted services, models, tools, and MCP servers. Each component is correlated to the workload executing it, the identity behind it, and its behavior over time. By baselining this activity, security teams can quickly spot anomalies such as new models, unauthorized integrations, or unusual usage patterns. More importantly, this visibility feeds directly into detection and response, enabling full attack storylines that include the AI layer.</div></a></div><div class="divider-full space small"></div><div class="div-block-773"><div class="writer-small dark"><img height="70" width="70" alt="Stream Team" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/67cf5e9a8c818ec67007d051_Large%20favicon3.webp" class="writer-image-small"><div><div fs-list-field="author" class="writer---blog-page-home">Stream Team</div></div></div><div class="div-block-790 xs w-condition-invisible"><div class="div-block-953"><div class="writer---blog-page-home date">Apr 27, 2026</div></div><div class="code-embed-3 w-embed"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<g clip-path="url(#clip0_2629_8)">
<path d="M6 3.86743V6.01029L7.28571 7.296" stroke="#92A1B1" stroke-width="0.857143" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
<path d="M5.99997 11.3571C9.42854 11.3571 11.3571 9.42854 11.3571 5.99997C11.3571 2.57139 9.42854 0.642822 5.99997 0.642822C2.57139 0.642822 0.642822 2.57139 0.642822 5.99997C0.642822 9.42854 2.57139 11.3571 5.99997 11.3571Z" stroke="#92A1B1" stroke-width="0.857143" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
</g>
