        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img alt="" loading="lazy" id="w-node-_2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63771-83c22e73" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/699db66c578e4e682a4dcfe1_openaiauditlogs_cover.jpg" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/699db66c578e4e682a4dcfe1_openaiauditlogs_cover-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/699db66c578e4e682a4dcfe1_openaiauditlogs_cover-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/699db66c578e4e682a4dcfe1_openaiauditlogs_cover-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/699db66c578e4e682a4dcfe1_openaiauditlogs_cover.jpg 1200w" class="post-image"><div class="post-content-div"><div class="div-block-992"><div class="div-block-1010"><div fs-list-field="category" class="blog-category">AI</div><div class="highlight-tag pop">Popular</div><div class="highlight-tag w-condition-invisible">Highlights</div><div class="hide w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div fs-list-field="Topic">AI SOC</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div fs-list-field="Topic">CDR</div></div></div></div></div><a data-wf-native-id-path="2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775_instance-9" data-wf-ao-click-engagement-tracking="true" data-wf-element-id="2e7022be-dae3-cc3c-2a30-63bd4fd63775" data-wf-cms-context="%5B%7B%22collectionId%22%3A%2265dbcab8c88303f083c22dc7%22%2C%22itemId%22%3A%22699db682b7641e82b9036553%22%7D%5D" href="/post/stream-security-now-supports-openai-platform-audit-log-ingestion-for-comprehensive-ai-control-plane-threat-detection" class="b-title w-inline-block"><h2 fs-list-field="title" class="heading-29 blog">Stream Security Now Supports OpenAI Platform Audit Log Ingestion for Comprehensive AI Control-Plane Threat Detection</h2><div class="blog-par limit-char">Stream Security now supports native ingestion of OpenAI Platform audit logs, extending real-time threat detection and response to your AI control plane. Security teams gain immediate visibility into sensitive administrative activity across OpenAI Platform Organizations including API key lifecycle events, service account creation, identity and role changes, project configuration updates, and security control modifications like IP allowlists and SCIM. The integration is agentless, easy to enable, and provides out-of-the-box detections so teams can investigate and respond faster from a unified cloud security platform.</div></a></div><div class="divider-full space small"></div><div class="div-block-773"><div class="writer-small dark"><img height="70" width="70" alt="Asaf Haski" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6877c24e9982eb4c671d0e00_Assaf.webp" sizes="70px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6877c24e9982eb4c671d0e00_Assaf-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5f05d5858fab461d0d08eaeb/6877c24e9982eb4c671d0e00_Assaf.webp 800w" class="writer-image-small"><div><div fs-list-field="author" class="writer---blog-page-home">Asaf Haski</div></div></div><div class="div-block-790 xs"><div class="div-block-953"><div class="writer---blog-page-home date">Feb 24, 2026</div></div><div class="code-embed-3 w-embed"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
